      "text": "Whether the prosecution proves beyond all reasonable doubt that without bearing the harassment and torture, on 12.12.2017, in her parents house, the wife of the accused had committed suicide by hanging, the accused had instigated and abetted her to commit suicide and thereby committed the offence punishable under sec.306 of IPC?\n3. What order?\n9. My findings on the above points are as hereunder:\nPoint No.1 and 2: In the negative Point No.3 : As per final order for the following:\n: REA S ON S :\n10. Points No.1 and 2 : Both the points involve common discussion.",
