    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 51,
      "text": "C.W.2/P.W.2 has turned hostile.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4801,
      "end": 4832,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13880689442157745
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 52,
      "text": "His evidence is the repetition of the testimony of his wife.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4833,
      "end": 4893,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13463664054870605
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 53,
      "text": "He is not aware of the reasons for the death of his daughter.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4894,
      "end": 4955,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14143675565719604
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 54,
      "text": "At the time of cross-examination by the prosecutor, he has denied the statement recorded by the police and it is marked as Ex.P.6.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4956,
      "end": 5086,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14163553714752197
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 55,
      "text": "12. C.W.3 is a brother of the deceased and he has examined as P.W.3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5087,
      "end": 5156,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13398419320583344
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 56,
      "text": "He has followed the path of his parents.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5157,
      "end": 5197,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1536802500486374
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 57,
      "text": "He does not know the reasons for the unnatural death of his sister.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5198,
      "end": 5265,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14690755307674408
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 58,
      "text": "The learned prosecutor has cross-",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5266,
      "end": 5299,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10528745502233505
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 59,
      "text": "examined.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5300,
      "end": 5309,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1146189495921135
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 60,
      "text": "He has denied the contents of the statement marked as per Ex.P.7.\n13.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5310,
      "end": 5379,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11220378428697586
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 61,
      "text": "C.W.16 is a I.O and he deposed as P.W.4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5380,
      "end": 5420,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09744913876056671
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 62,
      "text": "He had received the complaint, registered the case,\nreported FIR as per Ex.P.8 and conducted mahazar as per Ex.P.2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5421,
      "end": 5536,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17576344311237335
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 63,
      "text": "He had sent the dead body to Ambedkar Hospital with requisition as per Ex.P.9.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5537,
      "end": 5615,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ambedkar Hospital",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 5566,
          "end": 5583
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17283150553703308
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 64,
      "text": "He requested the Special Thasildar as per Ex.P.10 to conduct Inquest.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5616,
      "end": 5685,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1603711098432541
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 65,
      "text": "He had arrested the accused, recorded the further statement of C.W.2 & C.W.11 and statement of C.W.3 to C.W.10.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5686,
      "end": 5797,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17500437796115875
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 66,
      "text": "Inquest and Postmortem are marked as Ex.P.11 & 12.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5798,
      "end": 5848,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12805895507335663
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 67,
      "text": "The four photos of the dead body are marked as Ex.P.13.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5849,
      "end": 5904,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09917017072439194
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 68,
      "text": "He had completed the investigation and filed chargesheet.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5905,
      "end": 5962,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21437425911426544
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 69,
      "text": "14. It is worth to note that the parents and brother of the deceased are turned hostile.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5964,
      "end": 6052,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11297383159399033
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 70,
      "text": "They does not know the reasons for her death.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6053,
      "end": 6098,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15219198167324066
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 71,
      "text": "They have denied the demand and receipt of dowry.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6099,
      "end": 6148,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15610793232917786
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 72,
      "text": "They have also denied the suggestion that the accused had issued Divorce Notice to the deceased.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6149,
      "end": 6245,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13256587088108063
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 73,
      "text": "As per Ex.P.12,\nthe death was due to Asphyxia as a result of hanging.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6246,
      "end": 6315,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23501859605312347
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 74,
      "text": "Except the ligature mark, the medical officer had not find any other external injuries on the dead body.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6316,
      "end": 6420,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19831399619579315
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 75,
      "text": "There are no cogent evidence to establish that the accused had instigated and abetted the deceased to commit suicide.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6421,
      "end": 6538,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.38340863585472107
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 76,
      "text": "15. It is settled law that in case of alleged abetment of suicide, there must be a proof of direct or indirect act of incitement to the commission of suicide.",
      "rhetorical_role": "STA",
      "start": 6540,
      "end": 6698,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6546605825424194
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 77,
      "text": "Mere allegation of harassment of the deceased would not sufficient unless there be such action on the part of the accused which compels the person to commit suicide.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 6699,
      "end": 6864,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6464369893074036
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 78,
      "text": "Instigation means to provoke, incite or encourage to do an act.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 6865,
      "end": 6928,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6294388175010681
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 79,
      "text": "16. In the present case, the above essential elements are absent.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 6930,
      "end": 6995,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25538018345832825
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 80,
      "text": "There are no cogent evidence to establish that the accused has treated his wife with cruelty and she was subjected to harassment.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 6996,
      "end": 7125,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.574483335018158
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 81,
      "text": "Further, there is no evidence to establish the accused had abetted and instigated her to commit suicide.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 7126,
      "end": 7231,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5475821495056152
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 82,
      "text": "So, without any option, I answer these two points in the Negative.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 7232,
      "end": 7298,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.02248007245361805
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 83,
      "text": "17. Point No.3:",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 7299,
      "end": 7315,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.03714502975344658
    },
